# Reports

Fraudebot stores reports submitted by other users. Reports are the way where users can specify the individual/commpany who scammmed them and submit what happened and how. 

## Parts of a Report

A report is made up with the following parts:

- Profile Picture (JPG, PNG, WEBP)
- Scammer/Organization name
- Products
- Title
- Description
- Proofs (JPG, PNG, WEBP)
- Contacts
- Payment Methods
- Scammer (for organizations) or Organization (for scammers)

